<p>Thanks to Azzleflux, Vivax, blaqueheart, DrMrTheMinotaur, UglyFlower, TwistedGears, Roget, Crayne, and Fantem.</p>
<p>Yeah, I put a lot of work into this rewrite of another over-eager post of mine. Enjoy!</p>
<p>Oh, and one more thing. <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/codename-green-king-hub">This is slightly related to this.</a></p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
