<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>The dead woman is Josephine, after escaping a Foundation site. She was nearly caught, but she had to go to attend to a certain anomaly their. She summoned Salix and Willow who had gone into hiding after the fall of Eden, they got stuck in a looping tussle with the D-Class be causing Josephine's death.</p>
<p>This isn't the actual canonical death of Josephine, only my interpretation.</p>
<p>If you know what Eden is, then you get who the two pets are.<br />
<sup>And the link may or may not have to do with <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/t-537337/scp-1918#post-1521436">this post</a></sup></p>
